==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|en|file name}}

===Etymology===
Solidification of {{m|en|file name}}, compounded from {{com|en|file|name}}. Related to {{m|en|file system}}. The preference for the solid form {{m-self|en|filename}} over the spaced form {{m|en|file name}} in opposition to the preference for the spaced form {{m|en|file system}} over the solid form {{m|en|filesystem}} is probably influenced by the solidification of other compound nouns ending with {{m|en|name}} (for instance: {{m|en|place name}} > {{m|en|place-name}} > {{m|en|placename}}).

===Pronunciation===
* {{enPR|fīl′nām|a=GA}}, {{IPA|en|/ˈfaɪ.əl.neɪm/}}
* {{hyph|en|file|name}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|computing}} The [[name]] [[assign]]ed to a [[file]] in a [[file system]].

